<view class="page performances-page"><view class="performance-hero"><text>M-BOX · LIVE CALENDAR</text><text>{{title}}演出安排</text><text>只展示门店已经发布的歌手、乐队与场次。</text></view><view class="date-picker-card"><text>查看日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{selectedDate}}" start="{{minimumDate}}" bindchange="onDateChange"><view><text>{{selectedDate}}</text><text>选择日期 ›</text></view></picker></view><state-panel wx:if="{{loading}}" type="loading" title="正在读取已发布演出" /><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-banner">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{schedules.length}}" class="schedule-list"><view wx:for="{{schedules}}" wx:key="id" class="schedule-card"><image wx:if="{{item.imageUrl}}" src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view class="schedule-avatar" wx:else>LIVE</view><view><text>{{item.timeText}}</text><text>{{item.performer}}</text><text>{{item.tags || 'M-BOX 当晚舞台阵容'}}</text></view></view></view><state-panel wx:else type="empty" title="这天暂无已发布演出" message="日期可继续切换；演出发布后会自动显示在这里。" /></block><text class="schedule-note">演出安排可能调整，以门店当日已发布内容为准。</text></view>
